<topic template="Default" modified="2026-11-17T13:37:33.204Z" lasteditedby="robert" version="2" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="../helpproject.xsd">
  <title>DELETE DATABASE 命令</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>Databases</keyword>
    <keyword>DELETE DATABASE command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">DELETE DATABASE 命令</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">从磁盘中删除数据库容器（DBC）。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">DELETE DATABASE &lt;DbName&gt; [DELETETABLES] [RECYCLE]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;DbName&gt;<tab />要删除的数据库名称。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">DELETETABLES<tab />还会删除属于该数据库的表（.DBF 文件）。如果不使用此子句，这些表将不会被删除，而是成为空表。</para>
    <para styleclass="List">RECYCLE<tab />将已删除的文件移至“回收站”，而非永久删除。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">该命令由预处理器转换为对 XSharp.RDD.Dbc 类中 Delete() 方法的调用。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_CREATE_DATABASE">CREATE DATABASE</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_OPEN_DATABASE">OPEN DATABASE</link>, <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_REMOVE_TABLE">REMOVE TABLE</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
